{"seq":10,"slug":"lc0136-single-number","title":"LeetCode 136 只出现一次的数字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0136-single-number","wordCount":1010,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-136-只出现一次的数字\">LeetCode 136 只出现一次的数字</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个<strong>非空</strong>整数数组 <code>nums</code>，除了某个元素只出现一次以外，其余每个元素均出现两次。找出那个只出现了一次的元素。</p>\n<p>你必须设计一个线性时间复杂度的算法来解决此问题，且该算法只使用常量额外空间。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 3 * 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>-3 * 10^4 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 3 * 10^4</code></li>\n<li>除了某个元素只出现一次以外，其余每个元素均出现两次</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [2, 2, 1]&#10;输出：1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [2, 2, 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [4, 1, 2, 1, 2]&#10;输出：4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [4, 1, 2, 1, 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1]&#10;输出：1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题的独特之处在于对复杂度的严格要求——O(n) 时间、O(1) 空间。这排除了哈希表（O(n) 空间）和排序（O(n log n) 时间）的方案，迫使我们使用<strong>位运算</strong>这一强大工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"异或运算的三大性质\">异或运算的三大性质</h3><p>异或运算（XOR，符号 <code>^</code>）是解决本题的关键。它具有以下性质：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自反性</td>\n<td>a ^ a = 0</td>\n<td>任何数与自身异或为 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零元素</td>\n<td>a ^ 0 = a</td>\n<td>任何数与 0 异或为自身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交换律</td>\n<td>a ^ b = b ^ a</td>\n<td>异或顺序无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结合律</td>\n<td>(a ^ b) ^ c = a ^ (b ^ c)</td>\n<td>可以任意结合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"核心推导\">核心推导</h3><p>将数组中所有元素进行异或运算：</p>\n<p>由于交换律和结合律，异或运算的顺序不影响结果。出现两次的元素互相抵消（a ^ a = 0），而 0 与只出现一次的元素异或得到该元素本身（0 ^ x = x）。</p>\n<p>因此，整个数组的异或结果就是那个只出现一次的元素。</p>\n<h3 id=\"其他方法对比\">其他方法对比</h3><p>虽然题目要求 O(1) 空间，但了解其他方法有助于理解为什么异或是最优解：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>是否满足要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希表计数</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>空间不满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序后比较</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>时间不满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数学法（2×sum - totalSum）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>需要 Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异或运算</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>完全满足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数学法的思路\">数学法的思路</h3><p>将数组去重后求和，乘以 2，再减去原数组总和，差值就是只出现一次的数。但这需要 Set 来去重，空间为 O(n)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"异或法-推荐\">异或法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function singleNumber(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  let result = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    result ^= num;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> singleNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-reduce-的简洁写法\">使用 reduce 的简洁写法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function singleNumber(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  return nums.reduce((acc, num) =&gt; acc ^ num, 0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> singleNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">acc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行过程示例：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>nums = [4, 1, 2, 1, 2]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>num</th>\n<th>result（二进制）</th>\n<th>result（十进制）</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>000</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0 ^ 4 = 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>101</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4 ^ 1 = 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>111</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>5 ^ 2 = 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7 ^ 1 = 6（1 被抵消）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6 ^ 2 = 4（2 被抵消）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终 <code>result = 4</code>，正是那个只出现一次的数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"哈希表法-对比用\">哈希表法（对比用）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function singleNumber(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const freq = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    freq.set(num, (freq.get(num) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const [num, count] of freq) {&#10;    if (count === 1) {&#10;      return num;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return -1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> singleNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> freq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    freq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num, (freq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">num</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freq) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异或运算</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>完美满足所有要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>空间不满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>时间不满足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 只需遍历数组一次，每次异或操作为 O(1)（位运算是 CPU 的原子操作），总时间 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 只使用了一个变量 <code>result</code>，空间为 O(1)。这是本题的核心优势——异或运算不需要任何辅助数据结构。</p>\n<p><strong>位运算的扩展应用：</strong> 异或运算在算法中有广泛应用。LC #137（Single Number II）中每个元素出现三次，需要用更复杂的位运算（逐位统计）来解决。LC #260（Single Number III）中有两个只出现一次的元素，需要利用异或结果的最低有效位将数组分成两组。掌握异或的基本性质是理解这些进阶题目的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>实际工程中的位运算：</strong> 位运算在底层系统编程中非常常见，如网络协议的校验和计算、加密算法中的混淆操作、图形学中的颜色通道操作等。虽然在业务代码中较少直接使用，但理解位运算是计算机科学素养的重要组成部分。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 136 只出现一次的数字","id":"leetcode-136-只出现一次的数字"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"异或运算的三大性质","id":"异或运算的三大性质"},{"level":3,"text":"核心推导","id":"核心推导"},{"level":3,"text":"其他方法对比","id":"其他方法对比"},{"level":3,"text":"数学法的思路","id":"数学法的思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"异或法（推荐）","id":"异或法-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 reduce 的简洁写法","id":"使用-reduce-的简洁写法"},{"level":3,"text":"哈希表法（对比用）","id":"哈希表法-对比用"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 104 二叉树的最大深度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0104-maximum-depth"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 75 颜色分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0075-sort-colors"}}